  "layoutMapUrl": null,
  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 7 plays straight into the prevailing wind off Lady Bird Lake. What looks like a comfortable par 4 on paper plays a stroke longer when the breeze is up — club down and keep it low.",
  "localTips": "Gets crowded on weekends — go early morning or after 5pm. The wind off the lake is the real challenge, not the layout. Grab a taco on Barton Springs Road after your round.",

